l context: See the total cost of a feature in one view. Deep granularity: Drill down from the cluster level to Namespace, Deployment, Label, and Pod. Unit economics: Calculate cost-per-tenant or cost-per-transaction dynamically. Allocate Perfect allocation, retroactively Finout's Virtual Tags allow you to map technical resources to business logic without changing a single line of code. Logic-based rules: Group disparate namespaces and labels into clean \"Team\" or \"Product\" buckets. Shared Cost Reallocation: Automatically split the cost of shared clusters across the teams that use them. Retroactive updates: Change a tagging rule today and see it applied to historical data instantly. Optimize Stop paying for waste We analyze your actual utilization vs. requested resources to find savings. Rightsizing recommendations: Get actionable advice to lower CPU/Memory requests based on historical usage peaks (P90/Max). Idle pods management: Visualize \"Idle\" costs — the resources you pay for but don't use — so you can reduce wasted spend. Built for every stakeholder Everyone gets the data they need — without the need for manual spreadsheets 01 Finance & FinOps Allocation that adds up: Finally reach near-100% showback/chargeback accuracy. Budget with confidence: Forecast K8s spend based on actual business drivers, not just historical guessing. No more surprises: Get alerted on cost anomalies at the namespace or workload level before the month ends. 02 DevOps & Engineering No maintenance burden: Agentless options mean no agents to patch or secure. Rightsizing made easy: See exactly how much CPU/RAM your services actually need versus what they request. Self-service visibility: Give teams direct access to their own spend data so they can own their cloud footprint. Ready to see what your Kubernetes clusters actually cost? Get the granularity of a specialized tool with the platform power of a total FinOps solution. Book a demo The FinOps platform for cloud and AI spend, with agen