egment, and more. Lets you approve, edit, or reject suggestions individually or in bulk. Learns from your edits, so future suggestions get sharper over time. Automate Once your Virtual Tags are in place, Finout keeps allocation accurate and in sync as your spend and org evolve. Virtual Tag Sync – org-aware automation Sync teams, services, domains, products, and cost centers from Backstage, ServiceNow, Workday, or internal catalogs. Update allocation automatically when ownership changes, services move, or teams split. Keep reports aligned with your real org, not a stale tagging strategy. Allocation API – allocation as code Manage Virtual Tag rules via API or UI. Plug rule changes into CI/CD and internal approval workflows. Export fully allocated data to Snowflake, BigQuery, Looker, billing systems, or internal tools. Secure by Design. Built for Scale. SOC 2 Type II compliant, ISO 27001, GDPRT Dedicated FinOps support RBAC & SSO/SAML support One API key connects to entire stack Fully Automated Cost Allocation. This is FinOps in 2026 Stop organizing your business around the limitations of tags- Let AI Virtual Tags keep your allocation model in sync with reality as you grow. Book a demo The FinOps platform for cloud and AI spend, with agents that find the savings and act on them, so your team stays lean, and your coverage doesn't. PLATFORM Why Switch AI FinOps for AI Agents for FinOps Billy- FinOps AI Assistant FinOps for Agents Main Features MegaBill AI-Powered VTags Shared Cost CostGuard Anomaly Detection FinOps Dashboards Use Cases Consolidate Optimize Showback Kubernetes Financial Plans INTEGRATIONS AWS GCP Azure OCI Anthropic OpenAI Kubernetes Snowflake Databricks Datadog GitHub Twilio Cursor Confluent Grafana Fal.ai CircleCI RESOURCES Product Overview Documentation Customer Stories Blogs Webinars eBooks Tools COMPANY Contact Us Pricing Careers Join us! About Us Partners Media Kit Compliance © Finout 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy Terms of Use © Finout 2